# Code owners for the delivery path. Whoever can edit these can weaken the
# deploy guard, the manifests or the ruleset, so every change needs a code
# owner's review (infra/github/main-ruleset.json, require_code_owner_review).
#
# @REPLACE_WITH_OWNER is a placeholder: the operator replaces it with the real
# owner handle in a reviewed pull request before applying the ruleset
# (infra/github/README.md, step 6). Until then GitHub reports this file as
# invalid and no code-owner review can be satisfied.
/infra/           @REPLACE_WITH_OWNER
/.github/         @REPLACE_WITH_OWNER
/scripts/deploy/  @REPLACE_WITH_OWNER
/Dockerfile       @REPLACE_WITH_OWNER
